## About

{{ description }}

This Rust project was scaffolded with `a2a init --language rust`. It declares
the agent contract in native Rust code, compiles that declaration to
`.a2a/agent.dsl.json`, and serves the small localhost worker endpoint that the
common A2A sidecar invokes.

## Local Setup

```bash
cargo run -- compile
cargo run -- worker
```

`cargo run -- compile` writes `.a2a/agent.dsl.json`. The deployed container
builds the release binary and copies it to `./worker` beside `a2a sidecar`; the
public A2A/MCP endpoints are served by the sidecar.

## Deploy

```bash
a2a deploy
```
